  "hints": [
    "Recording a view must be cheap. Where do events go so counting happens elsewhere?",
    "Counts per time window are time-series data. And everyone reads the same top-K list.",
    "LB (2) → API (20) → Kafka → counters (10) → InfluxDB (2); API → Redis → InfluxDB for the list."
  ],
